# 생명 게임 데모 녹화용 vhs 테이프 (https://github.com/charmbracelet/vhs).
# 저장소 뿌리에서: vhs demos/demo.tape   # -> demos/demo.gif  (make demo로도 된다)

Output demos/demo.gif

Set FontSize 14
Set Width 680
Set Height 420
Set Padding 12
Set TypingSpeed 75ms

Type "./life -w 34 -h 18 -fps 12"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 10s
Ctrl+C
Sleep 1s
